Package: libtvision-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 libncurses-dev,
 libgpm-dev,
Description: Turbo Vision text-mode UI framework (development files)
 Turbo Vision is a framework for text-based user interfaces, providing
 windows, dialogs, menus, and other widgets for terminal applications.
 .
 This package ships the static library, public headers, CMake package
 configuration, and pkg-config metadata needed to build applications
 against Turbo Vision.

Package: tvision-demo
Section: misc
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: Turbo Vision text-mode UI framework (demo applications)
 Turbo Vision is a framework for text-based user interfaces, providing
 windows, dialogs, menus, and other widgets for terminal applications.
 .
 This package ships example applications built against Turbo Vision
 (tvedit, tvdemo, tvhc), useful for trying out the framework's widgets
 without building it from source.
